# shellcheck shell=bash
#
# Enter the flake's dev shell (sprite CLI, home-manager, jq, shellcheck) on cd.
#
# `use flake` already does `watch_file flake.nix flake.lock` in both
# implementations (nix-direnv's and direnv's own stdlib), so no watch_file
# lines are needed here. Do not watch home/sprite.nix: the dev shell does not
# depend on the guest home module, so watching it would invalidate the cached
# shell on every edit of it for no benefit.
use flake
